(a) GF(32), n=3, r=2: 576 (domain, labelling) pairs; max |P_seed[agree] - nu(D)| = 0.00e+00
(b) N=1: 32 seeds give 3 distinct functions on X; largest multiplicity 16 (so per-seed weights must be counted per program, not per function)
(b) N=2: 1024 seeds give 15 distinct functions on X; largest multiplicity 304 (so per-seed weights must be counted per program, not per function)
